    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mo The Moai",
    "steam_appid": 3562110,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you will take the body of a pair of shoes that never stop running, forcing you to jump and move forward throughout the entire game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/e7406fcf748582909661586f2c0fedb8.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/e7406fcf748582909661586f2c0fedb8.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Mo, your moai friend, you can charge energy, launch him, and propel yourself towards him. Mastering the charge , the timing of when to launch, and when to dash toward him is a skill only a few will achieve\u2014but it\u2019s essential to complete your mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/d4bfe5ff1078a256278dd9efc91f07ee.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/d4bfe5ff1078a256278dd9efc91f07ee.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall, every mistake, must be a lesson that makes you stronger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/73b5a67a39c9c4d0e8d9ce22cfcbc135.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/73b5a67a39c9c4d0e8d9ce22cfcbc135.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the vast Moai world , from its deep sewers to the white tower in top of the world, passing through unique environments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/1f5a7e018cb1d906f5b7705467a8ff79.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/1f5a7e018cb1d906f5b7705467a8ff79.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>So take on this challenge and embark on this epic adventure!</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world you will take the body of a pair of shoes that never stop running, forcing you to jump and move forward throughout the entire game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/e7406fcf748582909661586f2c0fedb8.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/e7406fcf748582909661586f2c0fedb8.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Mo, your moai friend, you can charge energy, launch him, and propel yourself towards him. Mastering the charge , the timing of when to launch, and when to dash toward him is a skill only a few will achieve\u2014but it\u2019s essential to complete your mission.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/d4bfe5ff1078a256278dd9efc91f07ee.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/d4bfe5ff1078a256278dd9efc91f07ee.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall, every mistake, must be a lesson that makes you stronger.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/73b5a67a39c9c4d0e8d9ce22cfcbc135.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/73b5a67a39c9c4d0e8d9ce22cfcbc135.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the vast Moai world , from its deep sewers to the white tower in top of the world, passing through unique environments.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/1f5a7e018cb1d906f5b7705467a8ff79.poster.avif?t=1746116378\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562110/extras/1f5a7e018cb1d906f5b7705467a8ff79.webm?t=1746116378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>So take on this challenge and embark on this epic adventure!</strong></i></p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready for an impossible quest! You and Mo, your Moai pal, must reach the Moai World\u2019s summit. Keep running, jumping, and climbing\u2014but beware! One mistake can sends you plummeting into the darkest depths of despair. Reach the top before the seventh day or the world resets. Learn, Adapt and Rise.",
